 help streamline our decision-making during crisis, and we have set up a task force to adapt to and learn from the new realities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/02/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q1-2020-ea.aspx"},{"c":"TIGO 2020 Q1","e":"tigo","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Pennington","x":"In addition, we're looking at cost savings of at least $100 million that will be through hiring freezes, reducing subsidies, cancellation of nonbusiness-critical activities and seeking reductions on contracts that will no longer generate returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/02/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q1-2020-ea.aspx"},{"c":"TIGO 2020 Q2","e":"tigo","d":"2020-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mauricio Ramos","x":"This will need to grow and improve to support remote work, online schooling, video streaming and overall connectivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q2-2020-ea.aspx"},{"c":"TIGO 2020 Q2","e":"tigo","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Pennington","x":"We did do a restructuring in Paraguay, which would give rise to a slightly higher withholding tax this year compared to last year, but it will give us lower withholding tax going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q2-2020-ea.aspx"},{"c":"TIGO 2020 Q2","e":"tigo","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stefan Gauffin","x":"So first of all, the $100 million in cost savings, you had $66 million this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q2-2020-ea.aspx"},{"c":"TIGO 2020 Q3","e":"tigo","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Lincoln Pennington","x":"Again, we have seen sequential improvement with cost-saving measures benefiting most markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/31/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q3-2020-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2020 Q4","e":"tigo","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mauricio Ramos","x":"And to our 21,000 employees, to them, we made a commitment to not to do any layoffs or furloughs and to protect the income of our commission-based sales staff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q4-2020-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2020 Q4","e":"tigo","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Pennington","x":"And despite the reduction in service revenue of over USD 1.50 million, we were able to compensate that through cost-saving reductions, which exceeded $100 million and to a lesser extent, lower Capex.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q4-2020-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2021 Q3","e":"tigo","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mauricio Ramos","x":"And in some countries, Soomit, like Colombia, we just took a price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q3-2021-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2021 Q4","e":"tigo","d":"2022-02-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Tim Pennington","x":"And in fact, on Monday streaming, we're going to target 2.5 times by 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q4-2021-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2021 Q4","e":"tigo","d":"2022-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mauricio Ramos","x":"And in fact, we have raised prices throughout the year in the vast majority of our markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/11/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q4-2021-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2022 Q1","e":"tigo","d":"2022-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mauricio Ramos","x":"Investing a little bit more in cable, streamlining our product offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q1-2022-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2022 Q2","e":"tigo","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mathieu Robilliard","x":"And then, looking at the other side of the coin in terms of pricing power, I realize in some markets it's quite consolidated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q2-2022-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2022 Q2","e":"tigo","d":"2022-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mathieu Robilliard","x":"But how easy is it to pass price increases or more for more initiatives in your countries overall?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/28/millicom-international-cellular-sa-tigo-q2-2022-ea/"},{"c":"TIGO 2026 Q1","e":"tigo","d":"2026-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bart Vanhaeren","x":"Growth was mainly driven by our pre to postpaid conversion strategy, together with the price increase implemented in February and March which supported the ARPU improvement that Marcelo mentioned earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/millicom-tigo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TIGO 2026 Q1","e":"tigo","d":"2026-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bart Vanhaeren","x":"Growth was driven by price increases in our B2C and home businesses as well as cybersecurity services provided to the government, which Marcelo discussed earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/millicom-tigo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TIGO 2026 Q1","e":"tigo","d":"2026-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marcelo Benitez","x":"This is a very solid outcome, particularly as it already reflects the impact of integration and restructuring charges related to the Coltel acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/c